    2. (Let callTargetKey be $callTargetKey(nameIR, (argumentIR)*))

    3. Return $find_overloaded<constructorTypeDefIR>(TC.global.constructor, callTargetKey, $parameterListIR_of_constructorTypeDefIR)

  2. Case (% matches pattern ``%`)

