def $is_static_callableTypeIR(callableTypeIR)

1. Case analysis on callableTypeIR

  1. Case (% has type externFunctionTypeIR)

    1. (Let (extern_function text ( (_parameterIR)* ): _typeIR) be (callableTypeIR as externFunctionTypeIR))

    2. If ((text = "static_assert")), then

